    rdf:value """Monday, June 3, 1907
Settignano. Cool. Fine.
Houghton and Cecil came to lunch, and took Karin and me in the motor to see the Villa Loretino, and also another, the Morelli across the river — also to call on the Brushes, who were out."""^^xsd:string ;
